---
title: CMN — Logout Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(@core/http)
    participant GW as Web Gateway
    participant AC as AuthController<br/>(POST /api/auth/logout)
    participant AS as AuthAppService<br/>.LogoutAsync
    participant JWT as JWT Claims
    participant R as Redis

    U->>FE: Click logout
    FE->>FE: Read accessToken from cookie ACCESS_TOKEN_KEY
    FE->>GW: POST /cmn/administration-service/api/auth/logout<br/>Header: Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}<br/>Header: X-Tenant: {tenantId}<br/>[Authorize — JWT required]
    GW->>AC: Forward
    AC->>AS: LogoutAsync()

    AS->>JWT: Extract claims from current request JWT
    JWT-->>AS: userId, sessionId

    AS->>R: DEL {userId}:{sessionId}
    R-->>AS: OK (key removed)

    AS-->>AC: void
    AC-->>GW: 200 ApiResult
    GW-->>FE: 200

    FE->>FE: cookie.remove(ACCESS_TOKEN_KEY)
    FE->>FE: cookie.remove(REFRESH_TOKEN_KEY)
    FE-->>U: Redirect to /signin
